# Line-ending policy for cross-platform sharing (2026-08-09, prep for
# multi-developer use incl. macOS): everything the build EXECUTES or PARSES
# must stay LF on every checkout - a shell script converted to CRLF by a
# Windows autocrlf checkout no longer runs under /bin/sh, and Makefiles/.ld
# with CRLF can confuse make/ld on POSIX systems.
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.pl      text eol=lf
*.mk      text eol=lf
Makefile* text eol=lf
*.ld      text eol=lf
